window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>As the end of the world nears, Sectors of the Nation wait at their televisions for the wise advice of their president. Instead, they are met with orders. At 3 PM, Collection begins. Those who do not cooperate will die.</p> <p>Those who do, enter The Void, a program built to create the world's first super humans by breaking down mankind's minds through gut-wrenching, manipulative, and apocalyptic simulations.</p> <p><i>The Void</i>, by Jinapher J. Hoffman, follows one woman's turmoil as she is forced into a sadistic prison. Will she overcome the darkness? What does it mean to become super human in a world on the verge of decay? How much does it take to truly break a mind?</p>"; 
